        "href": "/creativity-techniques-uem/lessons/en/creativity-techniques/u-1-introduction-creativity/#tao-of-creativity"
      }
    },
    {
      "slide_role": "masterclass",
      "background_kind": "profield",
      "media_slot_id": "U1.still.profield-3",
      "heading": "1 · Open, then close",
      "sentence": "First invent many possibilities. Then pick what fits the needs of the brief — one creative act can hold both moves.",
      "quote": "The same creative act may involve both divergent and convergent thinking.",
      "citation": {
        "label": "(Craft 2003, 43)",
        "href": "/creativity-techniques-uem/lessons/en/creativity-techniques/u-1-introduction-creativity/#ref-craft-2003"
      },
      "quote_origin": "ahmes",
