        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "slide_role": "masterclass",
      "background_kind": "profield",
      "media_slot_id": "U1.still.profield-4",
      "heading": "2 · Four skills you can train",
      "sentence": "Fluency (many ideas), flexibility (many angles), originality (unusual links), elaboration (work the details) — all trainable.",
      "quote": "Fluency - the ability to produce a large number of ideas or solutions to a problem rapidly.",
      "citation": {
        "label": "(Chen 2012, 41)",
        "href": "/creativity-techniques-uem/lessons/en/creativity-techniques/u-1-introduction-creativity/#ref-chen-2012"
      },
      "quote_origin": "ahmes",
      "semantic_tags": {
